.claude/

# Deadline pipeline run artifacts (created in CI, never committed) and the
# bytecode cache the scripts/tests produce. audit_lint.py inspects untracked
# files, so anything transient left in the tree must be ignored here or it
# trips the path allowlist and blocks the audit PR.
__pycache__/
/watchlist.json
/watchlist.md
/audit-summary.md
/audit-proposals.json
/audit-verdicts.json
